WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.509 --> 00:00:14.509
[Chorus]
There is a house in New Orleans

00:00:14.509 --> 00:00:15.509
They call the Rising Sun
And it's been the ruin of many a poor boy

00:00:15.509 --> 00:00:16.509
And God, I know I'm one

00:00:16.509 --> 00:00:34.750
[Verse 1]
My mother was a tailor

00:00:34.750 --> 00:01:10.530
She sewed my new blue jeans
My father was a gamblin' man

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:22.450
Down in New Orleans

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:29.670
[Verse2]
Now the only thing a gambler needs

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:35.080
Is a suitcase and a trunk
And the only time he'll be satisfied

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:38.670
Is when he's all drunk

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:40.100
[Organ Solo]

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:45.120
[Verse 3]
Oh, mother, tell your children

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:55.160
Not to do what I have done
Spend your lives in sin and misery

00:01:55.160 --> 00:02:00.180
In the House of the Rising Sun

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:07.350
[Verse 4]
Well, I got one foot on the platform

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:15.959
The other foot on the train
I'm goin' back to New Orleans

00:02:15.959 --> 00:02:20.260
To wear that ball and chain

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:22.550
[Chorus]
Well, there is a house in New Orleans

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:23.550
They call the Rising Sun
And it's been the ruin of many a poor boy

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:23.556
And God, I know I'm one

